Shiori
Copyright 2026 Shiori contributors

A desktop client for herdr-core written in Go with the MyGo framework.
It is an independent re-implementation of the Herdr desktop app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache License 2.0). The
behaviour, wire protocol usage, default key bindings
(internal/keys/default_keys.json) and program table
(internal/programs/programs.json) follow that project.

The logo (resources/logo.svg, resources/icon.png, resources/mark.svg) is
the character 栞 from Noto Sans CJK JP (https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk),
SIL Open Font License 1.1, converted to outlines.

Bundled third-party assets (internal/programs/icons):
- Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev), ISC License, with MIT-licensed
  Feather-derived icons. See internal/programs/icons/LICENSE-Lucide.txt.
- Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), CC0 1.0.
- LobeHub icons (MIT). See internal/programs/icons/LICENSE-LobeHub.txt.
